#: ../../source/reference/animationclip.rst:13
msgid ""
"An AnimationClip resource contains keyframe based animation data. The "
"animation data split to a number of tracks that must be connected with "
"the properties of Components. Each track can contain multiple curves or "
"channels like X, Y and Z Which allows them to animate elements "
"independently."
msgstr ""

